<title>ECUADOR: CEV coffee exporters to meet in Ecuador Monday.</title>
<headline>CEV coffee exporters to meet in Ecuador Monday.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coffee producers from Ecuador, Venezuela and Central American countries will meet in Quito Monday, according to Ecuador's National Association of Coffee Exporters Friday.</p>
<p>The meeting of the so-called CEV group will also be attended by high-level officials from Brazil and Colombia, the association's director Pablo Delgado Alava told Reuters.</p>
<p>CEV delegates will use the meeting to prepare common positions for upcoming meetings of the Association of Coffee Producing Countries and of the International Coffee Organization, Delgado Alava said.</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom +5932 25-8433</p>
</text>
